menu "ZW V1.0 board bring-up"
config ZW_BOARD_POWER_PATH_VERIFIED
    bool "PNP base current limiting and power-domain isolation verified on the physical board"
    default n
    help
        The supplied PCB ties PCF8574 outputs directly to PNP bases. The 10k
        resistors are base-emitter pullups, not series current limiting.
        Confirm hardware correction/current limits before enabling this target.
        Default firmware prints a diagnostic and does not initialize the loads.
config ZW_TEST_AUDIO
    bool "Run one ES8311 microphone level test at boot"
    default n
    help
        Bench test only. Captures PCM then enters codec standby and stops I2S.
        This does not implement speech recognition or continuous audio wake.
config ZW_TEST_DEEP_SLEEP
    bool "Enter deep sleep after 30 seconds, wake every 60 seconds or on touch"
    default n
    help
        Measurement mode. USB will disconnect in deep sleep. No BLE connection
        is maintained. Actuators and charging stay disabled; shared I2C rail
        and codec digital supply stay on with codec in software standby.
endmenu
